  "translations": {
    "translations": [
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "KR",
        "iso_639_1": "ko",
        "name": "한국어/조선말",
        "english_name": "Korean",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "사춘기 딸과의 전쟁, 허세 충만 백수 남편, 꽈배기집 폐업 위기까지. 지긋지긋한 현생을 견뎌오던 미영에게 초호화 크루즈 결혼식 초대장이 도착한다. “우리, 진짜 여행 가자!” 화려한 크루즈 여행을 만끽하던 것도 잠시. 범죄 조직의 리더 안야의 등장에 수백명이 탑승한 크루즈는 순식간에 사상 초유의 납치 사건 현장이 되어버린다. 도망칠 곳 없는 푸른 바다 한복판, 다시 한번 각성한 전직 레전드 요원 미영은 이제 가족을 구하고 세상을 지켜야 할 위험한 작전에 뛰어든다!",
          "runtime": 109,
          "tagline": "이번엔 크루즈다!",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "US",
        "iso_639_1": "en",
        "name": "English",
        "english_name": "English",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Six years after the Hawaii airplane hijacking, Mi-yeong finds herself struggling with her rebellious teenage daughter, Nari, and her unemployed husband, Seok-hwan. When Hyun-min, a flight attendant she met during the hijacking, invites her family to his wedding aboard a luxury cruise ship, Mi-yeong eagerly proposes a family holiday. Met with indifference from her husband and daughter, she decides to embark alone, joining Hyun-min's family and Ji-hoon, a charming magician. However, on the eve of the wedding, the celebration turns deadly when armed assailants seize the ship. After Seok-hwan and Nari are kidnapped and brought aboard, Mi-yeong discovers that she is the target of a much larger plot.",
          "runtime": 109,
          "tagline": "All aboard! OK?",
          "title": "OK! Madam: Bon Voyage"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "TW",
        "iso_639_1": "zh",
        "name": "普通话",
        "english_name": "Mandarin",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "麻花捲店倒閉危機、丈夫失業、女兒正值叛逆期……生活已經夠混亂了，沒想到連豪華遊輪之旅都不得安寧！當昔日王牌特務重出江湖，這趟假期，將變成最失控的爆笑救援行動！",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "特務搞飛機2"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "CN",
        "iso_639_1": "zh",
        "name": "普通话",
        "english_name": "Mandarin",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "曾经是传奇特工的美英如今重新过着平凡的家庭生活，一边经营麻花店，一边应付丈夫和进入青春期的女儿。一次偶然的机会，一家人收到邀请登上一艘豪华游轮，原本只想享受难得的假期，却没想到以安雅为首的犯罪组织突然控制游轮，数百名乘客因此陷入危险。身处无处可逃的茫茫大海，美英不得不再次拿出早已隐藏起来的本领，在保护家人的同时设法阻止犯罪分子的行动……",
          "runtime": 100,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "OK老板娘2"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "RO",
        "iso_639_1": "ro",
        "name": "Română",
        "english_name": "Romanian",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "La șase ani după deturnarea avionului din Hawaii, Mi-yeong se confruntă cu dificultățile cauzate de fiica ei adolescentă rebelă, Nari, și de soțul ei șomer, Seok-hwan. Când Hyun-min, un însoțitor de zbor pe care l-a cunoscut în timpul deturnării, îi invită familia la nunta sa, care va avea loc la bordul unui vas de croazieră de lux, Mi-yeong propune cu entuziasm o vacanță de familie. Întâmpinată cu indiferență de soțul și fiica ei, ea decide să plece singură, alăturându-se familiei lui Hyun-min și lui Ji-hoon, un fermecător magician. Totuși, în ajunul nunții, sărbătoarea devine fatală atunci când atacatori înarmați preiau controlul navei. După ce Seok-hwan și Nari sunt răpiți și aduși la bord, Mi-yeong descoperă că ea este ținta unui complot mult mai amplu.",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "OK! Madam: Bon Voyage"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "TH",
        "iso_639_1": "th",
        "name": "ภาษาไทย",
        "english_name": "Thai",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "\"มียอง\" อดีตสายลับระดับตำนาน ได้รับคำเชิญไปร่วมงานแต่งงานบนเรือสำราญพร้อมครอบครัว แต่ก่อนที่งานเฉลิมฉลองจะเริ่มต้น เรือทั้งลำกลับถูกแก๊งอาชญากรยึดกลางมหาสมุทร จากคุณแม่ธรรมดา...สู่สายลับที่ต้องกลับมาจับอาวุธอีกครั้ง เพื่อปกป้องครอบครัว ช่วยเหลือผู้โดยสาร และหยุดยั้งแผนการร้าย ก่อนที่เรือแห่งการเฉลิมฉลองจะกลายเป็นฝันร้าย",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "แม่มาบู๊! กู้เรือนรก"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "TR",
        "iso_639_1": "tr",
        "name": "Türkçe",
        "english_name": "Turkish",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Mi-young, ergenlik çağındaki kızı ve işsiz eşiyle günlük hayatın zorluklarıyla mücadele ederken, lüks bir yolcu gemisinde gerçekleşecek düğüne davet edilir. Ailesiyle keyifli bir tatil yapmayı hayal eden Mi-young için yolculuk, suç örgütü lideri Anya ve adamlarının gemiyi ele geçirmesiyle bir anda kabusa dönüşür. Açık denizin ortasında kaçacak hiçbir yer kalmazken, geçmişte efsanevi bir ajan olan Mi-young yeniden harekete geçmek zorunda kalır",
          "runtime": 0,
